      "description": "Convective channel with per-cell ThermalPort arrays for fuel plate coupling. v1.1: thermal_left[1:n] / thermal_right[1:n] connect to HeatDiffusion (axis autoflips via default_axis=vertical, locked into opposing-pair by pair_with). htc_correlation and friction_correlation are Properties-tab kwargs; geometry-bearing factories derive their geometry from this Channel's geometry resource via geom_source=\"parent\" (Phase 59 geom-first).",
      "ports": [
        { "name": "port_in", "type": "FlowPort", "side": "left" },
        { "name": "port_out", "type": "FlowPort", "side": "right" },
        { "name": "thermal_left", "type": "ThermalPort", "array_size": "n", "default_axis": "vertical", "pair_with": "thermal_right" },
